The M0 gradient patch of scikit-learn 1.9.1 (BSD-3-Clause, LICENSE-SCIKIT-LEARN).
It sums over the targets before the trace, so the gradient needs no
(n, n, targets) array. Apply it in site-packages with: patch -p1 < this-file
